┗┅┅┅┅┅┅┹┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┄┘
`
            java.log(tips)
            java.longToast(tips)
        } else {
            throw new Error(res.msg)
        }
    } catch (e) {
        //java.log(e)
